# Python and Flask specific ignores
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
*.egg
.env
.venv/
venv/
ENV/
env/
env.bak/
venv.bak/
instance/

# IDE specific files
.vscode/
.idea/

# Build artifacts
[Bb]uild/
[Dd]ist/

# Log files
*.log

# Databases
*.sqlite3
*.db

# Uploads and Results directories (ignore contents, not the dirs themselves)
# Ensure these paths are from the root of the repo
/uploads/*
!/uploads/.gitkeep
/results/*
!/results/.gitkeep

# Jupyter Notebook checkpoints
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Pytest cache
.pytest_cache/
```

I added a few more common entries like `ENV/`, `env/`, `.ipynb_checkpoints`, and `.pytest_cache` for completeness, and ensured the upload/results paths are explicitly from the root.
